Package: abfunnel
Title: Design, Check and Analyse Digital Marketing Experiments and Funnels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Supports online controlled experiments (A/B and A/B/n tests)
    and conversion funnels in digital marketing research, from planning to
    reporting. Plans sample size and duration, checks sample ratio mismatch
    (Fabijan et al., 2019, <doi:10.1145/3292500.3330722>), and estimates
    differences and relative lifts with confidence intervals, Holm-adjusted
    tests and the Bayesian probability that each variant beats the control.
    Analyses each step of a funnel and writes a self-contained report that
    puts effect sizes and uncertainty before significance, with a template
    for pre-registering experiments.
